{"id":"word:hebrew:H4940","type":"word","title":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","subtitle":"H4940 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a family , i.e. circle of relatives ; figuratively, a class (of persons), a species (of animals) or sort (of things); by extension a tribe or people","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִשְׁפָּחָה (H4940) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 304 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִשְׁפָּחָה (mishpâchâh) means a family , i.e. circle of relatives ; figuratively, a class (of persons), a species (of animals) or sort (of things); by extension a tribe or people First listed occurrence: 1Chr 2 53."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","transliteration":"mishpâchâh","pronunciation":"mish-paw-khaw'","strong":"H4940","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4940","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["מִשְׁפַּ֖חַת","לְ/מִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֖/ם","לְ/מִשְׁפְּחֹתָ֑/ם","מִשְׁפְּחֹ֥ת","לְ/מִשְׁפְּחֹתָֽ/ם"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncfpc/Sp3mp",87],["HNcfsc",81],["HNcfpc",48],["HR/Ncfsc",14],["HR/Ncfpc",13],["HNcfpa",8],["HR/Ncfpc/Sp3ms",5],["HTd/Ncfsa",5],["HC/Ncfsc",5],["HC/Ncfpc",4]]},"definitions":{"short":"a family , i.e. circle of relatives ; figuratively, a class (of persons), a species (of animals) or sort (of things); by extension a tribe or people","usage":"family, kind(-red).","full":"H4940. mishpachah מִשְׁמָּחָה : 303 noun feminine clan (RS Semitic 1. 258, 2nd ed. 276; K 149, 2nd ed. 175 Ba NB § 161 a ); — absolute ׳מ Amos 3:1 +; construct מִשְׁמַּ֫חַת Judg 9:1 +; suffix מִשְׁמַּחְתִּי Gen 24:38 +, etc.; plural מִשְׁמָּחוֺת Nahum 3:4 +; construct מִשְׁמְּחוֺת Amos 3:2 +; suffix מִשְׁמְּחֹתֵיהֶם Gen 8:19 2 t., usually תָם - Num 1:18 84t., etc.; — 1 clan: a. family connection of individual Gen 24:38 (+ בֵּיתאָֿבִי ), 24:40 ( + id. ), 24:41 (all J; = מוֺלַדְתִּי 24:4 ), 2Sam 14:7 , united in sacrifice 1Sam 20:6 , 29 , in passover Exod 12:21 (J E; compare Benz Ency.Bib. PASSOVER, §§ 9, 12 ); compare Lev 20:5 (H), 25:10 , 41 (P), 25:49 (P; defined as בְּשָׂרוֺ מִשְּׁאֵר ), non-Hebrew 25:47 (H), 25:45 (P), Judg 1:25 ; מִשְׁמְּחוֺתֶיהָ Josh 6:23 (E or R) is unintelligible, probably strike out (compare Steuern Holz; אָבִיהָ בֵּית in 6:25 [J]), compare Num 27:4 , 11 (P); ׳מ אִמּוֺ אֲבִי בֵּית Judg 9:1 clan of his mother's father-house ; including individuals, and included by שֵׁבֶט 1Sam 9:21 (twice in verse); 10:21 ; with specific name, in series שֵׁבֶט ׳מ, בַּיִת, גֶבֶר, Josh 7:14 (twice in verse); 7:17 b, c (all J; 7:17 a read plural Di Benn, or שֵׁבֶט GFM Judg 13:2 ; Steuern allows either); compare Deut 29:17 ; Judg 21:24 , ׳מ בְּיִשׂ ׳אָבִי 1Sam 1:18 (+ חַיַּי , see II [ חַי ]; ׳אִישׁמִ֗֗֗מּ בֵּיתשָֿׁאוּל 2Sam 16:5 ; with name also Ruth 2:1 , 3 and (non-Israel) Job 32:2 . b. in loose, popular sense= tribe , Judg 13:2 ; 17:7 ; 18:19 , compare 18:2 (|| שֵׁבֶט 18:1 ), 18:11 (yet in these two read possibly plural, see GFM). c. techn. divisions of people of Israel Num 11:10 (J) Jer 2:4 ; 31:1 ; compare 3:14 ; Num 1:2 , 18 ; 2:34 ; 33:54 (all P), so (post-exilic) Neh 4:7 : Est 9:28 ( דּוֺר ׳מ, מְדִינָה, ). d. usually (P) technical divisions of tribes of Israel , Exod 6:14-15 , 25 ; Num 3:15 112t. Numbers (93 t. Numbers 26, including 3:43 where הַשּׁוּחָמִי apparently = Dan), 34 t. Joshua 13-21; also 1Chr 6:4 ; 6:45 ; 7:5 ; Zech 12:13 ; division of Gershom, etc. (in Levi) Num 3:18-19 , 20 41 t. Exodus, Numbers, Joshua, Chronicles; subdivisions of these divisions (in Levi) 3:21 (twice in verse) + 6 t. Numbers 3 + 4:18 ; compare (in other tribes) 1Chr 2:53 ; 4:2 , 8 , 21 , 27 , 38 ; 5:7 ; also Zech 12:12 b. c 13 b 14 a, and (distributive) 12:12 a 14 b, pleonastic ׳מ אֲבִיהֶם מַטֵּה Num 36:6 compare 36:8 , and ( מ ׳מַטֵּה ׳א ) 36:12 . e. late, divinity of other peoples 1Chr 16:28 = Psa 96:7 ; 22:28 ; in Edom Gen 36:40 (P). f. in wider sense=people, nation ; תָאֲדָמָה מִשְׁמְּחֹת כֹּל Amos 3:2 ; Gen 12:3 ; 28:14 (both J), compare Jer 10:25 ; Ezek 20:32 ; Nahum 3:4 (all || גּוֺיִם ), Zech 14:17 ; Jer 1:15 ; 25:9 ; as one's posterity Gen 10:30-31 , 32 (all P), so probably 10:5 (P; Di Dr); = all Israel Amos 3:1 , Judah Micah 2:3 ; Jer 8:3 ( ׳הַמּ הַזּאֹת הָרָעָה ), Israel + Judah, הַמּ ׳שְׁתֵּי 33:24 ; מִצְרַיִם מִשְׁמַּחַת Zech 14:18 ; compare Psa 107:41 . 2 = guild 1Chr 2:55 (of scribes; originally hereditary in families). 3 = species, kind: a. of judgments Jer 15:3 . b . animals Gen 8:19 (P). 4 plural = aristocrats Job 31:34 (compare English 'the classes'). שֻׁמִּים proper name, masculine see √ שׁפף .","rootNote":"from 8192 (compare 8198 );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 2 53","keyReferences":["1Chr 2 53","1Chr 2 55","1Chr 4 2","1Chr 4 8","1Chr 4 21","1Chr 4 27","1Chr 4 38","1Chr 5 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":304,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 2 53","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":53,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִשְׁפְּחוֹת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 55","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":55,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִשְׁפְּח֤וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִשְׁפְּח֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִשְׁפְּח֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִשְׁפְּח֛וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 27","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִשְׁפַּחְתָּ֔/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 38","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":38,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/מִשְׁפְּחוֹתָ֑/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference"